      "guid": "ca.bushtail.ratshotofunusualsize",
      "name": "Ratshot of Unusual Size",
      "slug": "ratshot-of-unusual-size",
      "teaser": "For Rodents of Unusual Size",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/nfEenbAKdbpiB4HksnXJWZYwYDOI0JnhIftSjjbH.jpg",
      "downloads": 1971,
      "favourites_count": 2,
      "description": "<p>Have you been ratted one too many times? Tired of PMCs camping and stealing all your hard-earned loot? Pick up a box of 50 BMG Ratshot at your local Ref today! One box of these babies sells for just 7.99 GP*!</p>\n<p>*Disclaimer, GPennies are discontinued and price will be rounded up to the nearest whole number. Boxes only available at Ref level 4.</p>\n<p>Models were made by the lovely <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/64077/darzhar\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Dar’Zhar</a> author of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1960/vrhands-ultimate\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">VrHands Ultimate</a> with assistance from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/36153/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EpicRangeTime</a> in the first of hopefully many collaborations!</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2487/ratshot-of-unusual-size",
